Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe\Nit's finally happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi versus Pegasus\Nfor his grandpa's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything we've been working\Nfor comes down to this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't let that creep intimidate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just play your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what Croquet's up to, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean Mokuba's missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He is instrumental in the\Nplan to take over Kaibokor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him immediately, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How hard can it be to\Nrecapture a soulless body?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not make me come down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.65,0:01:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some way to go, Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd go and check on Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been gone a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Too long, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.89,0:01:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what could be more\Nimportant than this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make your move, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's not like I\Ndon't already know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you'll lay the Spellbinding\NCircle Trap face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, you'll throw out the\NSummoned Skull in Defensive Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly prepared. It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And first, I'm laying this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'll lay the Summoned\NSkull in Defensive Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.43,0:02:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll leave it at that. Goody, now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my turn once again you see the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,never lies nor does it fail inciting the\Nvulnerabilities for your pathetic moves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm switching reran into attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,reran fire stream attack
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:03:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With your attack you've activated my\Ntrap card, the Spell Binding Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,my circle has stopped\Nyour attack and that's not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.03,0:03:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,all it also ensnares ryu\Nran in a binding spell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of magic oh no and reduces\Nhis attack power by
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,700 points all right looks\Nlike pegasus is in big
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, little Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,with my skull poised for attack and the\Nmagic of my spellbinding circle traps,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,in full effect ryu ran will be struck
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:04:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,down go lightning strike attack not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so fast yugi i play this what what is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that the trap well a trap four traps
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,actually it's called trap displacement\Nand with it i can take the spell binding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Circle you set on one of my monsters\Nand switch it to one of yours. Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,no now ryu rand's attack pointer back\Nto normal and my summon skull 700 points
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,weaker why it's almost as if i knew\Nexactly what you were thinking isn't it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My Summon Skull won't\Nbe able to last another
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,turn with that Spellbinding\NCircle entrapping him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Skull won't even last this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire stream attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus knows every dueling\Nstrategy I think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hide anything from his eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That mind-reading cheat, what the\Nheck's they're using going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad it looks,\Nwe can't give up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't over till it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta believe Yugi will find\Nthe way to beat this creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to believe in Yugi,\Nno matter how bad things look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got Mokuba. Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No place left to run, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over the kid, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, come and get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay one hand on the boy and you will rue\Nthe day you imbeciles were of a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You just walked into a\Nworld of trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now step out of those shadows right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.51,0:06:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Step out of those shadows, or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else you'll do what,\Nyou pathetic little drones?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and now I am warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't trifle with me. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chain energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth? I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, now is our chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up! Hey, stop! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, those brats are getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Squad here. We need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure it's another\Nperfectly prepared move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to keep his\Nmillennium eye from reading my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at the mercy of my Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know every card\Nyou keep in your deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and have in my possession\Nevery card needed to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see every strategy your\Nfeeble mind has concocted,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and have already designed my own counter-tactics\Nto render them completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.85,0:07:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But even without my millennium\Nmagic, you're no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, who needs magic with this card?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'll remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Magical Toon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As you recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon World protects my monsters beneath\Nits impenetrable hardback bindings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bindings that they'll only vacate\Nwhen they're about to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and seeing how all my monsters have been
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,transformed to their\Nsuper-powered Toon Form,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it will be an attack that's\Ncertain to leave you in stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Yugi boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a sense of humor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.57,0:08:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Manga Riran, attack the monster\NYugi has in defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty nostril flame attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.53,0:09:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your giant soldier of\Nstone couldn't stand the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't my Toon simply marvelous?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel the same proud\Nsatisfaction that a parent would.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's my reward\Nfor having created the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Toon World card is one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It was thought too\Npowerful for distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he was able\Nto beat Kaiba with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I think I'll switch the\NToon Mermaid into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to let her out of her shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep throwing my\Nmonsters in defensive mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' toons will just\Nkeep picking them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My only chance is to take the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe by attacking, I can uncover some\Nkind of weakness in these toon monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My Guardian may not pack enough\Npunch to beat that mermaid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But with both their attacks at 1,400,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,she shouldn't be able to beat him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian, Silverblade Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The clam caught my attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That toon caught Yugi's attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That matchup should have been a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoulda, woulda, coulda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you're all just going to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,have to accept the\Nreality of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's guardian is the cat of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And if there's one thing I love, besides\Nwinning, that is, It's a fish fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was no draw. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off with those toons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, maybe if I\Nplay a stronger card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No card in your deck is strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My toon monsters can't be\Nbeaten by sheer brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what can I do? Attacking is useless.\NThat Millennium Eye gives Pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,access to my every card thought and\Nstrategy how can i possibly win this duel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my turn yuki boy\Nand i think i'll just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.37,0:11:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,lay these two cards face down on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,More to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With those two cards out,\NI guess I should defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It may cost me a monster, but it's\Nbetter than losing life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, that's the reason\Nwhy I play this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And then behold the trap\Nknown as Gorgon's Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find his\Nglance most arresting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My imp he's been turned to\Nstone as well, every other
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,monster you throw in defensive\Nmode for the Gorgon's Eye is a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,permanent trap and you should\Nknow that every time i destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,one of his concrete victims\Nhalf of their defensive power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,will be deducted from your life\Npoints sorry but there is a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,bright side to having a set of\Nfossilized monsters yugi boy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,they make fine paperweights
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,tough crowd well
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,here maybe you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can learn to lighten up from\Nmy second face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doppelganger, the copy card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Know why he's grinning, Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this little fella loves\Nwhat he does and does what he loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He used this on Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This little rascal can transform himself\Ninto any card on the field that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, beg your pardon,\Nany card that he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So which one will it be this\Ntime, Doppelganger, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You always have the best ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi-Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems that he would\Nlike to transform into that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoned Skull that I\Ndefeated a few turns ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in my graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but your graveyard\Npile is on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's fair game for my doppelganger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my furry friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really something, isn't it, Yugi boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can copy one of your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,recruit him to my team, and turn\Nhim into a toon all in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, a dark\Nnew chapter of Toon World
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,has been written the\Nchapter of fiends and here's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,our story's protagonist\Nor antagonist depending
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,upon your point of view\Nthe toon skull what have
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing compared to what\Nhe's going to do to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're twisted, Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,to take such delight in\Ncreating such a monstrosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, you'll hurt its feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not know it, but beneath that\Ngraphic exterior lies a very sensitive toon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, just move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon Skull, lightning strike attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Hornimp is demolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and since he was first turned\Nto stone by my mystic Gorgon's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Half his defense power is\Nremoved from your light points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What splendid showmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Yugi boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll coerce him to do\Nan encore a little bit later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:15:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That creep sure loves\Nto hear himself talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop that muscle-headed Toon\Nlike a balloon. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic of Toon World\Nmakes it seem impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've drawn the\Nfabled Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your favorite card, if I'm not mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His trouncing should be\Nespecially painful for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I so look forward to when you\Nput him into play, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can crush him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it you did back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Using that magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But for real. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Those gods are still behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but something's up with\Nyou and you're gonna tell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,me what it's a no-go the\Nstore's locked come on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, mama, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.81,0:17:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even try attacking those toons\Nwhile they're inside that magic book.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Gorgon's Eye turns any\Ndefense monster I throw to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It all just seems so hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:18:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you having a private\Nconversation with yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so gauche, I really must learn to not\Nkeep butting into other people's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, accepting defeat\Nis such a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you listen to him, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember everything at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandpa, Mokuba, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all counting on you, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and we know that you're going\Nto come through for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in you! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and Taya are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to remember\Nwhat I'm fighting for here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To save the soul of my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And the souls of both\Nthe Kaiba brothers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, seeing as how jumping's\Nout of the question,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say we're as good as Cod.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are! Come on! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean we tried?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not captured just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're totally outmanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be after I enlist some\Nhelp from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Hang tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I give up hope now, I'll\Nlose those three forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Their souls will remain\Nimprisoned in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And Pegasus will be free to continue\Nhis evil ways with no one to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As hopeless as it seems,\NI have to keep battling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi boy, you can't even save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo. Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
